          "Id": "10d5f50605014c1d905323eb2ddbbd78",
          "Name": "material",
          "Description": "A Material to apply to the faces of the DirectShape\n\nMaterial\nDefault value : Revit.Elements.DirectShape.DynamoPreviewMaterial",
